WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:07.799
[moody, intense intro music plays]

01:24.834 --> 01:25.835
[pained sigh]

01:34.552 --> 01:36.137
Are you selfish, Dong-eun?

01:36.930 --> 01:38.389
Why are you studying this late?

01:38.473 --> 01:40.350
We're all waiting.

01:45.021 --> 01:46.356
[Hye-jeong chuckles]

01:48.483 --> 01:49.567
You coming?

01:51.152 --> 01:53.988
Oh, right. Moon Dong-eun.

01:54.072 --> 01:55.990
You want to study architecture, right?

01:56.866 --> 02:00.120
Hey, ask me if you have
any questions, huh?

02:00.203 --> 02:02.497
If it's construction, I'm knowledged.

02:03.581 --> 02:04.415
[Myeong-o chuckles]

02:04.499 --> 02:07.585
-[emphatically] "Knowledgeable."
-That's what I said, you crazy bitch.

02:07.669 --> 02:09.504
No, dumbass, you said "knowledged."

02:09.587 --> 02:11.798
[Myeong-o] Don't try to teach me stuff,
you fucking moron.

02:11.881 --> 02:14.217
[Yeon-jin singing
"Two of Us" by Chae-yeon]

02:26.688 --> 02:28.648
[solemn choral music playing]

02:43.663 --> 02:46.374
[Dong-eun] All the feet
that walked next to yours,

02:46.457 --> 02:48.126
ready to inflict pain…

02:50.545 --> 02:53.131
All the lips that curled up with you

02:53.214 --> 02:54.966
when you laughed at others…

02:56.676 --> 02:59.220
All the eyes that looked on

02:59.804 --> 03:01.514
with no compassion…

03:01.598 --> 03:03.141
[Yeon-jin continues singing]

03:06.269 --> 03:07.103
[cruel chuckle]

03:14.152 --> 03:17.739
[solemn choral music continuing]

03:21.534 --> 03:24.078
[Dong-eun] All the hands that held yours,

03:25.580 --> 03:26.915
that broke me to pieces…

03:29.167 --> 03:30.126
And your soul,

03:30.877 --> 03:33.880
which laughed joyously through all of it…

03:35.632 --> 03:38.885
That's how far
I'm planning to go, Yeon-jin.

03:39.928 --> 03:41.846
I won't show you forgiveness.

03:42.722 --> 03:46.059
And there will be no glory.

03:48.311 --> 03:49.604
You crazy bitch!

03:51.981 --> 03:55.235
-Stop. Stop it!
-Why are you acting like a high schooler?

03:57.111 --> 03:58.988
Did all your dreams come true?

03:59.614 --> 04:01.741
It seems like you have
a pretty decent job right now,

04:01.824 --> 04:05.078
and you married a wealthy, connected man
when you were young and pretty.

04:05.161 --> 04:06.663
Are you living a happy life?

04:07.830 --> 04:10.959
You have what you wanted. Right, Yeon-jin?

04:13.836 --> 04:15.838
[people laughing]

04:15.922 --> 04:18.049
-[woman] Careful.
-Be careful with that.

04:18.132 --> 04:20.885
[all singing "Happy Birthday"]

04:21.761 --> 04:24.555
[mouthing along silently]

04:26.140 --> 04:29.477
[group continues singing]

04:34.274 --> 04:35.608
[laughter]

04:39.070 --> 04:40.905
[Yeon-jin] What are you trying to do?

04:40.989 --> 04:43.408
You must've seen
that article about my marriage!

04:43.908 --> 04:46.369
-What the fuck do you want from me?
-Hey, hey!

04:46.869 --> 04:48.788
You're not gonna kill her
right here and now.

04:48.871 --> 04:50.456
There's a crowd of kids outside.

04:51.207 --> 04:52.333
Be the bigger person.

04:52.917 --> 04:53.918
She's still a kid.

04:54.627 --> 04:56.129
-An angry little kid.
-[stifles laughs]

04:59.340 --> 05:02.302
[Dong-eun] You guys
really haven't changed at all.

05:02.385 --> 05:05.305
Neither has your friendship. I'm jealous.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.641
Well, you've changed a bit.

05:09.892 --> 05:12.186
In high school,
you were like a black-and-white picture.

05:13.354 --> 05:14.772
You're more colorful now.

05:15.565 --> 05:16.524
Think so?

05:18.693 --> 05:20.111
I've got to get going, okay?

05:21.988 --> 05:23.990
Looking forward to your next forecast.

05:24.490 --> 05:26.993
I hope you don't mind
that I watch you, Yeon-jin.

05:27.702 --> 05:29.203
[chilling music plays]

05:30.330 --> 05:33.249
Anyway, nice to see you all.

05:35.001 --> 05:36.210
By the way, Jae-jun.

05:37.920 --> 05:41.090
How would you even know
what's "colorful" or not?

05:41.174 --> 05:43.634
[menacing music plays]

05:52.894 --> 05:56.230
UNGHAN HIGH SCHOOL
2022 PROUD ALUMNI AWARDS CEREMONY

05:57.607 --> 05:59.817
[music swells, fades away]

06:13.873 --> 06:14.874
Here's the bag.

06:14.957 --> 06:16.042
You didn't come to work,

06:16.125 --> 06:18.211
and you've been
ignoring my calls all day long.

06:19.504 --> 06:21.089
You know what confuses me?

06:21.172 --> 06:23.257
Why I keep giving you
all these fucking paychecks

06:23.341 --> 06:24.717
when I seem to drive my car more.

06:26.552 --> 06:27.470
Sorry.

06:28.137 --> 06:29.555
I passed out kinda drunk.

06:31.808 --> 06:33.476
But anything else?

06:33.559 --> 06:34.894
[frustrated sigh]

06:37.939 --> 06:39.774
Find out what Dong-eun's been up to.

06:43.903 --> 06:44.862
Uh, Moon Dong-eun?

06:46.531 --> 06:48.074
Ah, that girl--

06:48.157 --> 06:50.451
Yeah, that girl who you kissed once.

06:50.535 --> 06:51.786
How long will it take?

06:56.833 --> 06:58.000
By any chance,

07:00.503 --> 07:02.213
did you ever sleep with that girl?

07:03.965 --> 07:05.091
Did she have your kid?

07:06.592 --> 07:07.427
Are you fucking high?

07:08.261 --> 07:09.345
Are you insane?

07:09.429 --> 07:10.888
Have you finally lost it, you idiot?

07:10.972 --> 07:12.598
[door opens]

07:13.391 --> 07:15.476
Oh, is it gonna be us three?

07:15.560 --> 07:16.727
It won't.

07:22.191 --> 07:24.193
He doesn't buy me fucking handbags.

07:29.240 --> 07:32.118
[woman] Wow,
the view's so pretty at night.

07:32.618 --> 07:36.038
Babe, should I just drop everything
and live here with you?

07:36.539 --> 07:38.040
What's your name again?

07:39.750 --> 07:40.793
Ha-na.

07:40.877 --> 07:41.878
[Jae-jun chuckles]

07:43.004 --> 07:44.380
Sweet Ha-na.

07:44.464 --> 07:46.924
You're not the sharpest tool
in the shed, are you?

07:47.967 --> 07:50.636
Ha-na. Do I look stupid?

07:52.054 --> 07:53.681
You can't even tell me your real name,

07:53.764 --> 07:55.183
but you've got big dreams.

07:56.142 --> 07:58.060
That makes me so fucking sad.

08:01.772 --> 08:02.773
[exhales]

08:06.110 --> 08:07.361
Hey, Ha-na.

08:08.237 --> 08:09.780
You call yourself a redhead, right?

08:09.864 --> 08:11.657
[scoffs] Yeah.

08:14.994 --> 08:15.828
Are you blind?

08:16.412 --> 08:17.914
[menacing music plays]

08:19.916 --> 08:20.750
Ha-na.

08:21.792 --> 08:23.294
[startled gasp]

08:24.253 --> 08:26.214
Guess what two bitches I hate the most?

08:27.340 --> 08:29.759
Anne of Green Gables
and Red Riding Hood Chacha.

08:29.842 --> 08:31.677
And since you're a redhead too,

08:33.095 --> 08:35.932
maybe I should show you
what I'd do to bitches like that.

08:36.516 --> 08:37.934
-[panicked whimpering]
-Huh?

08:39.769 --> 08:43.523
Call me if you get a consultation request
for Mr. Yoon in room 701.

08:43.606 --> 08:46.025
Excuse me, Yeo-jeong.
Can I ask you something?

08:46.108 --> 08:48.194
Ask me. He has to go now.

08:48.861 --> 08:50.238
You can go, I got this.

08:50.321 --> 08:53.032
I wouldn't be leaving
if you weren't the one in charge. Call me.

08:53.115 --> 08:54.116
I'll be back later.

08:58.538 --> 08:59.622
What's your question?

08:59.705 --> 09:02.542
I heard a rumor
that Yeo-jeong's the director's son.

09:02.625 --> 09:05.169
Really? He's the director's son?

09:05.253 --> 09:06.796
Not the daughter, huh?

09:06.879 --> 09:08.548
Because pink looks great on him.

09:08.631 --> 09:10.007
Wow, so it's true, huh?

09:10.508 --> 09:11.968
I just found out yesterday.

09:12.468 --> 09:15.388
So then, Jong-heon, Yeo-jeong's father,

09:15.471 --> 09:19.642
is the former director
who passed away, wasn't that right?

09:19.725 --> 09:21.310
You're really gonna go there?

09:21.394 --> 09:22.645
Just look it up online.

09:27.692 --> 09:30.528
Did he really get murdered
by the patient that he saved?

09:31.153 --> 09:33.281
Today is the anniversary of his death.

09:33.364 --> 09:35.992
-That's why Yeo-jeong went home.
-Oh.

09:37.660 --> 09:40.079
But how do you know
the anniversary of his death?

09:40.162 --> 09:42.582
Because Yeo-jeong's mother is
my second cousin.

09:42.665 --> 09:44.834
Ah. What?

09:57.263 --> 09:59.015
Shouldn't a doctor know not to smoke?

10:02.560 --> 10:04.228
I have to do something to unwind.

10:07.023 --> 10:08.858
You ate before you came here, right?

10:08.941 --> 10:10.192
Are you drinking tonight?

10:12.111 --> 10:14.447
Your uncles are already completely drunk.

10:16.198 --> 10:18.117
-You ready?
-I'll write it now.

10:24.624 --> 10:25.499
Use this.

10:26.083 --> 10:27.335
It was your father's.

10:28.753 --> 10:29.962
It's yours now.

10:39.221 --> 10:42.058
Let's go. Your father is waiting for you.

10:47.855 --> 10:49.857
[gentle, mournful music playing]

11:06.040 --> 11:08.459
JOIN US, FATHER,
WHO DEVOTED YOUR LIFE TO LEARNING

11:38.739 --> 11:41.951
-[Sa-ra] I thought I saw a ghost.
-[Hye-jeong] Bet she showed up on purpose.

11:42.034 --> 11:44.704
[Sa-ra] She knew what she was doing.
Nobody knows what she's up to?

11:44.787 --> 11:46.497
Myeong-o, you should look into it.

11:46.580 --> 11:48.582
[Myeong-o] Who's gonna pay me
for that, and how much?

11:49.417 --> 11:51.419
[suspenseful music playing]

12:03.848 --> 12:05.891
[Hye-jeong] Bring me
what I asked for, first.

12:10.855 --> 12:12.857
[camera shutter snapping]

12:15.067 --> 12:16.694
[grunts] The color…

12:17.945 --> 12:19.029
Hey.

12:21.532 --> 12:23.451
Uh, show me that one.

12:28.414 --> 12:30.916
[Hye-jeong] By the way,
are you okay, Yeon-jin?

12:31.000 --> 12:34.044
What if weird rumors start spreading
online or at your work?

12:34.545 --> 12:37.631
What if someone throws an egg
at you on your way back home?

12:37.715 --> 12:39.800
Dong-eun is such a bitch.

12:39.884 --> 12:40.843
Sad face.

12:40.926 --> 12:42.678
-This fucking bitch.
-[phone rings]

12:43.596 --> 12:44.430
MY PUPPY

12:46.348 --> 12:48.893
Hi sweetie, how was lunch at school today?

12:48.976 --> 12:50.644
I'm about to head home right now.

12:50.728 --> 12:55.357
[Ye-sol] Oh, okay. Mom, I spilled milk
all over my slippers at school,

12:55.441 --> 12:56.817
so I'm barefoot right now.

12:56.901 --> 12:58.569
You're barefoot now?

12:59.278 --> 13:00.696
That's so dangerous, hon!

13:01.197 --> 13:03.073
Did you tell your teacher what happened?

13:03.574 --> 13:06.619
Our homeroom teacher
isn't Mr. Yang anymore.

13:08.037 --> 13:09.288
What do you mean by that?

13:09.371 --> 13:11.499
We're going to get a new one.

13:11.582 --> 13:12.917
She's coming soon.

13:13.584 --> 13:14.418
Really?

13:15.377 --> 13:17.004
I didn't hear anything about…

13:18.088 --> 13:19.590
I'll visit your school tomorrow.

13:20.174 --> 13:22.510
I think you'll be happy.
She's your friend.

13:23.385 --> 13:24.929
Huh? Who's that?

13:25.012 --> 13:26.305
My new homeroom teacher.

13:26.388 --> 13:28.724
Her name's Ms. Moon Dong-eun.

13:30.559 --> 13:32.561
[tense music playing]

13:33.854 --> 13:36.732
Your new teacher is Moon Dong-eun?

13:37.316 --> 13:38.651
[teacher] Nice to meet you.

13:41.070 --> 13:42.822
[Shin-tae] Please tell her

13:42.905 --> 13:45.616
everything she needs to know
about our school.

13:45.699 --> 13:46.700
-Mr. Principal.
-We will.

13:47.284 --> 13:50.996
[Shin-tae] All right, thank you.
Make sure you take good care of Ms. Moon.

13:51.080 --> 13:53.165
[Dong-eun] I'm going to be
your new homeroom teacher,

13:53.249 --> 13:56.460
since Mr. Yang had to leave,
and I'm very excited to be here.

14:00.214 --> 14:01.674
From this moment forward,

14:01.757 --> 14:04.718
the following things
will be meaningless in this class.

14:05.719 --> 14:08.931
Your parents' money.
Your parents' connections.

14:09.515 --> 14:10.933
Your parents' jobs.

14:11.976 --> 14:15.396
And please make sure you are
always following these rules.

14:16.021 --> 14:18.858
You may not bully another student

14:19.525 --> 14:23.070
because your parents own nicer clothes,
better cars, or bigger homes.

14:24.280 --> 14:26.407
If you still decide to bully a friend,

14:26.490 --> 14:30.411
I will make you and your family
beg for forgiveness.

14:30.494 --> 14:32.413
The mother who bought your clothes,

14:33.414 --> 14:35.082
the father who drives that sports car,

14:35.165 --> 14:37.209
and the grandparents
who bought that house.

14:41.213 --> 14:42.882
Let's make this a great year.

14:43.465 --> 14:45.342
[students] We will!

14:45.426 --> 14:47.845
[tense music continuing]

14:51.223 --> 14:52.892
Let's brush our teeth.

14:54.268 --> 14:55.728
Give me your toothbrush.

14:58.606 --> 15:00.649
I wonder how she knows the chairman.

15:00.733 --> 15:02.818
I mean, he introduced her himself.

15:04.486 --> 15:06.614
Maybe she's a relative.

15:07.615 --> 15:11.702
[scoffs] Come on, Mr. Kang,
are you trying to act like a good guy,

15:11.785 --> 15:13.913
pretending to be all innocent and naive?

15:16.165 --> 15:17.291
You proud of yourself?

15:19.835 --> 15:20.836
I'm sorry.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.463
She's fucking him.

15:23.797 --> 15:24.840
Definitely.

15:25.633 --> 15:26.508
Hundred percent.

15:45.444 --> 15:47.446
[engine revs]

16:24.900 --> 16:26.694
You're Ye-sol's homeroom teacher?

16:28.570 --> 16:29.488
Seriously?

16:31.699 --> 16:34.576
Ye-sol was barefoot
because she spilled milk on herself.

16:35.744 --> 16:38.539
Her tiny, little feet
were so small and soft.

16:40.374 --> 16:41.792
This isn't a coincidence, right?

16:42.376 --> 16:43.293
Not at all.

16:44.294 --> 16:46.797
No part of my journey here
has been a coincidence.

16:46.880 --> 16:47.881
[scoffs]

16:49.925 --> 16:52.136
I've walked into your trap, haven't I?

16:52.219 --> 16:53.762
Right into your little trap.

16:54.763 --> 16:55.681
[Yeon-jin exhales]

16:55.764 --> 16:56.765
Unbelievable.

16:59.601 --> 17:01.937
I thought you'd find
some shitty guy somewhere,

17:02.021 --> 17:04.314
have a bunch of shitty children with him,

17:04.398 --> 17:05.649
and live a shitty life.

17:05.733 --> 17:06.900
But I'm impressed.

17:06.984 --> 17:08.902
How long have you been planning this?

17:08.986 --> 17:10.696
I'm disappointed you don't know.

17:10.821 --> 17:12.197
I told you, you're my dream.

17:12.281 --> 17:13.407
[menacing music plays]

17:13.490 --> 17:15.492
I said I'd see you again. Remember that?

17:15.576 --> 17:16.577
[phone chiming]

17:17.786 --> 17:21.623
I bet you had fun every single day
as you made your way here.

17:22.458 --> 17:24.626
Trying to get here
was really, really tough.

17:25.127 --> 17:27.129
But I admit, it's pretty fun now.

17:27.212 --> 17:29.590
I wish you had died
back in fucking high school!

17:29.673 --> 17:30.924
Where would the fun be?

17:31.717 --> 17:33.886
Even an evil bitch like you
is living a great life,

17:33.969 --> 17:34.970
so why not?

17:36.805 --> 17:38.932
Then we'd never have met each other again.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.102
And his is so fun for me.

17:42.936 --> 17:46.148
Welcome to my classroom,
where I make the rules, Yeon-jin.

17:50.986 --> 17:52.821
Oh, right. Of course you do.

17:53.947 --> 17:56.533
If nothing about this was coincidental,

17:56.617 --> 17:58.702
I'm sure you've got
some real fucked-up rules.

17:59.286 --> 18:03.123
But a nobody like you
doesn't stand a fucking chance.

18:04.166 --> 18:06.585
Okay, fine. Do your best.

18:08.253 --> 18:09.088
Good luck.

18:18.722 --> 18:20.599
[phone chiming]

18:25.479 --> 18:28.065
HYE-JEONG: REMEMBER
OUR SENIOR YEAR HOMEROOM TEACHER?

18:28.148 --> 18:29.399
HIS WIFE JUST CONTACTED ME

18:29.483 --> 18:30.734
JAE-JUN: SUCH A SOCIALITE

18:30.818 --> 18:32.069
HYE-JEONG: HE'S DEAD

18:35.739 --> 18:37.699
[Hye-jeong] Apparently,
that teacher's dead.

18:41.578 --> 18:44.456
[unsettling music playing]

18:52.339 --> 18:54.925
[Jong-mun] So you grew up
to become a teacher?

18:55.509 --> 18:57.010
You went to school?

18:58.011 --> 18:59.096
Yes, Mr. Kim.

18:59.805 --> 19:01.056
And it was all thanks to you.

19:02.641 --> 19:04.309
So I came here to thank you.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.438
Oh, uh, hey, I'll take that.

19:08.522 --> 19:11.024
My father has asthma,
so he can't be near flowers,

19:11.108 --> 19:12.192
especially lilies.

19:13.402 --> 19:15.904
Then these can be
your congratulatory flowers.

19:16.488 --> 19:17.489
Congratulations.

19:18.031 --> 19:20.284
I heard you passed
your School Inspector Exam.

19:20.367 --> 19:23.287
[chuckles] How'd you find out
about that already?

19:23.996 --> 19:25.873
I came here as soon as I found out.

19:26.373 --> 19:29.418
I passed the first part of the exam,
and I just have the interview left.

19:29.501 --> 19:31.753
I'm a bit worried about
the in-depth interview, though.

19:31.837 --> 19:33.505
Come on, there's no need to worry.

19:34.089 --> 19:36.091
Your family's full of great educators.

19:37.426 --> 19:39.219
On the day
I tried to withdraw from school,

19:39.303 --> 19:41.597
-you even took off your watch--
-Shut your goddamned mouth!

19:41.680 --> 19:42.639
Uh, Dad, what--

19:42.723 --> 19:45.184
You're nothing but a fucking leech!

19:45.767 --> 19:47.769
You're a piece of garbage, you bitch!

19:48.270 --> 19:50.939
Hey! Stop, Dad! Hey, hey!

19:51.440 --> 19:55.652
Hey, do you really think
you'll be fine after ruining my life? Huh?

19:55.736 --> 19:57.029
[coughing]

19:57.112 --> 19:59.364
If I had known
that this was going to happen,

19:59.448 --> 20:02.492
-I would have killed you then, you little…
-Jesus, Dad!

20:02.576 --> 20:06.246
Mr. Kim, were you concerned at all
when you ruined mine?

20:06.330 --> 20:09.041
Dong-eun, hold on,
you need to calm down as well.

20:09.124 --> 20:10.667
Come on, Dad, go inside.

20:11.460 --> 20:13.295
The neighbors might see you. Come on.

20:13.378 --> 20:17.090
Those are all lies. Okay?
Don't listen to her!

20:25.182 --> 20:26.099
Moon Dong-eun.

20:27.476 --> 20:30.354
What is going on here?
What's this? What happened?

20:30.979 --> 20:34.399
I decided to tell you
before I posted on the official forum.

20:34.483 --> 20:36.568
[spluttering] Post what? What'd you say?

20:37.152 --> 20:40.113
Of course, I know
that you didn't do anything wrong.

20:40.614 --> 20:41.698
Still,

20:43.033 --> 20:44.743
I didn't do anything wrong either.

20:46.578 --> 20:48.497
And you're a fully grown adult now.

20:48.580 --> 20:49.581
But you know…

20:51.124 --> 20:53.168
I was only 17 years old.

20:53.252 --> 20:56.338
[suspenseful music playing]

21:03.553 --> 21:05.305
Did you do that?

21:07.224 --> 21:08.642
You did that to Mr. Kim?

21:09.226 --> 21:10.936
Well, what exactly
are you asking me about?

21:11.728 --> 21:12.646
His death,

21:13.730 --> 21:14.898
or his punishment?

21:14.982 --> 21:17.359
-[siren wailing]
-[Soo-han sobbing]

21:18.694 --> 21:19.861
[Soo-han] Dad!

21:19.945 --> 21:21.989
Oh my God, Dad!

21:24.783 --> 21:25.993
Oh my God!

21:28.287 --> 21:30.414
[Soo-han] The congratulatory flowers
are here.

21:34.835 --> 21:36.586
I'm a father too, now, Dad.

21:38.297 --> 21:40.716
A father should do everything
for his child, shouldn't he?

21:41.383 --> 21:43.468
What do… What are you…

21:43.552 --> 21:46.555
[coughs] What are you…

21:46.638 --> 21:48.432
I only have the interview left.

21:50.100 --> 21:51.351
I'm so close to my goal.

21:52.019 --> 21:54.396
And I'll try my best
to help you with that.

21:56.231 --> 21:58.400
-Uh, I may have retired, but--
-[groans]

21:58.483 --> 21:59.901
Can you open the window?

22:00.819 --> 22:02.154
No, no, no.

22:03.030 --> 22:04.239
Don't be like that, huh?

22:04.323 --> 22:06.992
You know that rumors
travel fast in this industry.

22:07.075 --> 22:08.076
Rumors spread,

22:08.160 --> 22:09.786
and they become your reputation.

22:12.998 --> 22:14.541
Take this back.

22:17.252 --> 22:18.253
Okay.

22:18.754 --> 22:21.465
Soo-han, please open the window…

22:22.799 --> 22:25.052
There's only one thing you can do for me.

22:27.137 --> 22:28.638
You need to remain

22:29.598 --> 22:31.183
a proud father I can respect,

22:31.266 --> 22:33.685
the man who received
the Order of Service Merit.

22:34.978 --> 22:38.023
-[Jong-mun wheezing]
-Do that for me. Please.

22:40.275 --> 22:42.402
Soo-han, open the window…

22:49.743 --> 22:52.371
Oh my God! Dad, Dad!

23:01.338 --> 23:03.256
[Dong-eun]
Mr. Kim brought that on himself.

23:03.340 --> 23:05.384
I didn't do anything.

23:06.843 --> 23:08.720
And if you want
to look for another culprit,

23:08.804 --> 23:10.889
that would be you, not me.

23:12.641 --> 23:13.642
You fucking bitch.

23:13.725 --> 23:15.143
[chuckles wryly]

23:15.227 --> 23:16.645
Right, that's it.

23:17.854 --> 23:19.898
I'm so glad
that you haven't changed a bit.

23:21.775 --> 23:22.692
How about now,

23:23.735 --> 23:25.987
we discuss what actually brought you here?

23:27.030 --> 23:27.948
About your daughter.

23:31.243 --> 23:35.247
Ye-sol is innocent,
soft-hearted, and kind.

23:36.164 --> 23:37.416
I guess Ye-sol

23:39.084 --> 23:40.669
will really be your punishment after all.

23:40.752 --> 23:42.170
I'll fucking kill you.

23:43.422 --> 23:46.174
If you even touch
a single hair on Ye-sol's head,

23:46.758 --> 23:48.009
you are fucked.

23:48.093 --> 23:49.845
[sarcastic chuckle] I'm so curious.

23:50.679 --> 23:51.930
What will you do?

23:52.931 --> 23:56.393
You've already broken my whole body.
You've already crushed my soul.

23:56.893 --> 23:58.603
Is there anything left for you to do?

23:58.687 --> 24:00.939
[tense music playing]

24:02.566 --> 24:03.775
Transferring Ye-sol?

24:04.276 --> 24:05.652
Don't even think about it.

24:06.570 --> 24:09.865
Because I'll just move schools with her.

24:10.949 --> 24:12.868
From now on, you are going to suffer.

24:13.785 --> 24:15.162
Just like I did.

24:30.594 --> 24:31.428
[tires screech]

24:42.314 --> 24:44.316
[tense music continuing]

24:58.705 --> 24:59.789
Fuck this!

25:01.583 --> 25:03.084
[agitated seething]

25:29.986 --> 25:32.239
[Hye-jeong] How much should I give
for Mr. Kim's mourning?

25:32.322 --> 25:33.907
Fuck, his wife texted me again.

25:33.990 --> 25:37.244
[Sa-ra] 100,000 won for schoolmates,
500,000 for friends,

25:37.327 --> 25:40.956
1,000,000 won for pet dogs,
50,000 won for your homeroom teacher.

25:41.039 --> 25:43.875
[Hye-jeong] How much
will you give at my wedding, then?

25:44.376 --> 25:45.627
[Sa-ra] One hundred.

25:45.710 --> 25:47.546
[Hye-jeong] Oh my God.

25:48.463 --> 25:49.297
[Sa-ra] Won.

25:52.384 --> 25:53.385
That bitch…

25:56.513 --> 25:59.349
[suspenseful music playing]

26:02.602 --> 26:03.603
[sighs]

26:12.654 --> 26:14.447
[snoring loudly]

26:35.218 --> 26:38.471
I'm sorry to ask, but do you mind
holding the umbrella, sir?

26:39.264 --> 26:41.600
The wine that the secretary's office
told me to give to you

26:41.683 --> 26:42.934
is in the passenger seat.

26:51.359 --> 26:53.528
It's from Mr. Shin, from Hanjinmaru.

26:54.362 --> 26:56.615
Oh. You can drink that.

26:56.698 --> 26:59.451
If Mr. Shin sent it,
it's worth over a million won.

26:59.534 --> 27:00.368
What?

27:01.119 --> 27:03.330
Oh, no, no, I can't do that, sir.

27:06.916 --> 27:08.918
Well, it looks like my hands are full.

27:10.295 --> 27:12.380
I can't take something so expensive that…

27:13.214 --> 27:16.468
I don't know how to drink this.
It's such fine wine, sir.

27:16.551 --> 27:20.221
I should be the one
telling you that, which I am.

27:21.348 --> 27:22.932
So I don't know what the issue is.

27:23.767 --> 27:24.976
Sir?

27:25.060 --> 27:28.647
Buy some really cheap wine
at the convenience store.

27:28.730 --> 27:29.981
Buy some cheese too.

27:30.732 --> 27:32.817
Drink the convenience store wine first,

27:32.901 --> 27:33.902
then that.

27:35.654 --> 27:36.988
Then you'll learn how to drink it.

27:37.072 --> 27:38.573
I'll see you tomorrow.

27:46.414 --> 27:48.416
[pensive music playing]

28:00.220 --> 28:01.763
[entrancing music playing]

28:05.225 --> 28:06.810
[sighs]

28:08.687 --> 28:10.730
[Dong-eun] Do you know
what I used to wish for?

28:13.608 --> 28:14.943
Hi, Daddy!

28:16.069 --> 28:18.780
Oh, my sweet angel. My treasure.

28:18.863 --> 28:19.906
Oh, baby.

28:22.742 --> 28:24.577
[Dong-eun] I used to wish that one day,

28:25.161 --> 28:28.540
I would be able to forget
your name and your face,

28:29.207 --> 28:32.544
and that I wouldn't even remember you.

28:32.627 --> 28:34.045
That I'd be able to say

28:35.171 --> 28:36.172
"Who was that?"

28:37.632 --> 28:40.677
if I happened to run into you somewhere.

28:43.596 --> 28:47.225
Think about how sad all of it is.

28:48.643 --> 28:51.938
My entire world is all about you.

28:53.690 --> 28:55.942
And because my world is all about you,

28:57.318 --> 28:59.946
the world that your daughter
will live in from now on

29:00.655 --> 29:01.823
will be all about me.

29:03.908 --> 29:07.328
I promise I'll take responsibility
for that resentment,

29:08.705 --> 29:10.498
in return for my revenge.

29:16.629 --> 29:20.800
TO YEON-JIN

29:20.884 --> 29:22.886
[footsteps approaching]

29:35.732 --> 29:37.901
How did this happen? Who did this to you?

29:43.031 --> 29:45.200
I got the picture
that you sent over to me,

29:47.118 --> 29:49.788
along with the photo you sent of So-hee.

29:50.622 --> 29:52.040
Thank you so much for that, ma'am.

29:52.123 --> 29:53.875
Of course, I needed to.

29:55.460 --> 29:57.003
I was young back then, too.

29:58.797 --> 30:00.882
Were you close back then with So-hee?

30:05.345 --> 30:07.889
Can I have some pads? Ones without wings.

30:07.972 --> 30:09.057
Yes, one moment.

30:16.481 --> 30:19.234
[pharmacist] Here's the hydrogen peroxide
and the burn ointment.

30:19.317 --> 30:20.401
4,700 won.

30:27.325 --> 30:28.159
[Dong-eun] No.

30:28.243 --> 30:29.077
YOON SO-HEE

30:29.160 --> 30:30.703
When So-hee was getting bullied,

30:32.038 --> 30:32.872
I was

30:34.833 --> 30:36.376
a bystander.

30:37.335 --> 30:39.420
And then later, I became a victim too.

30:42.298 --> 30:43.758
And that means that now,

30:45.343 --> 30:47.136
I'm going to be the perpetrator.

30:48.346 --> 30:49.931
It might be a little too late,

30:50.557 --> 30:52.392
but I can't stay a bystander.

30:53.726 --> 30:54.561
Then…

30:56.312 --> 30:58.565
will this be the start
of a long battle for you?

30:59.691 --> 31:00.525
Yeah.

31:02.277 --> 31:04.612
Well, the only thing I can tell you is

31:06.072 --> 31:07.240
I hope you win.

31:08.950 --> 31:12.203
I was rooting for you
back when you were 17 years old,

31:12.287 --> 31:15.498
and now that you're 35,
I'm still cheering you on.

31:19.252 --> 31:20.253
Thank you.

31:21.880 --> 31:22.714
I will

31:24.465 --> 31:25.967
make sure I win this time.

31:26.509 --> 31:27.343
[train horn blows]

31:37.645 --> 31:40.315
There you are. You had me worried.

31:41.399 --> 31:42.567
Why would I not show up now?

31:43.276 --> 31:45.695
-Heard you met with the others.
-You didn't tell them, did you?

31:46.195 --> 31:47.030
That you met me.

31:47.113 --> 31:48.781
Why would I tell them about that?

31:49.657 --> 31:52.660
I've bet everything I have on you. All in.

31:55.038 --> 31:55.872
So, listen,

31:58.708 --> 32:01.210
you're dead if you drag me
into some half-baked scheme.

32:06.466 --> 32:07.842
[chuckles]

32:07.926 --> 32:09.260
You eaten yet? [crunches]

32:13.514 --> 32:14.682
It won't take too long.

32:14.766 --> 32:16.851
We can make it long. Let's get some food.

32:17.685 --> 32:18.519
What do you want?

32:27.695 --> 32:28.780
[Myeong-o] Excuse me.

32:29.364 --> 32:30.698
One bottle of soju.

32:35.078 --> 32:36.079
Eat something.

32:36.871 --> 32:37.747
Already ate.

32:38.748 --> 32:39.624
Show me.

32:53.429 --> 32:54.263
Want a drink?

32:54.347 --> 32:55.723
I already had some.

32:55.807 --> 32:56.808
[chuckles]

33:05.566 --> 33:06.901
Sa-ra's drug account book.

33:07.402 --> 33:09.237
The guy Hye-jeong's obsessed with.

33:13.324 --> 33:14.325
And the hair I gave you?

33:15.785 --> 33:16.953
Matched.

33:20.581 --> 33:23.251
For real? Jae-jun has a kid out there?

33:23.751 --> 33:25.586
-Where?
-That's my card to play.

33:27.672 --> 33:28.506
You take this.

33:28.589 --> 33:29.507
MORTUARY

33:32.593 --> 33:35.680
Why am I going to a mortuary?

33:36.848 --> 33:40.435
-This a better card to play?
-It is if you're just looking for money.

33:40.518 --> 33:43.104
When you're there,
you'll see who's waiting.

33:43.187 --> 33:45.189
[mysterious music playing]

33:47.108 --> 33:49.027
So, this is gonna make me some money,

33:50.028 --> 33:50.862
huh?

34:01.873 --> 34:03.541
This is D-3. Right here.

34:10.548 --> 34:12.383
YOON SO-HEE
PROCESSED ON 12/15/2004

34:15.136 --> 34:15.970
This means…

34:17.555 --> 34:21.017
So-hee has been kept in here
for over a decade?

34:21.100 --> 34:22.226
Yeah, she has.

34:22.310 --> 34:24.479
A hundred million of unpaid bills.

34:24.979 --> 34:28.649
The police concluded it was a suicide,
but her parents still don't agree.

34:29.233 --> 34:31.694
And the parents haven't been
picking up our calls.

34:31.778 --> 34:35.239
We can't remove the corpse
if the family members don't consent.

34:36.240 --> 34:37.241
Can I, uh…

34:40.286 --> 34:43.206
Can I see it now?
You know, uh, the corpse?

34:43.289 --> 34:44.665
Oh, I don't think…

34:46.250 --> 34:48.628
-You're not family, are you?
-No. Uh…

34:49.212 --> 34:50.213
We were friends.

34:51.380 --> 34:52.924
We hung out a lot in school.

34:53.007 --> 34:55.635
Then you need to be accompanied
by a family member.

34:55.718 --> 34:57.637
This is a big problem for us too.

34:57.720 --> 35:01.766
So just try to convince
the family members, will you? Huh?

35:01.849 --> 35:02.809
About her body.

35:02.892 --> 35:05.061
It's fine if they give up on it,
all right?

35:08.815 --> 35:10.900
[Dong-eun] You want to know
what I want, Yeon-jin?

35:12.944 --> 35:16.030
Do you think I could use
Myeong-o's butterfly wings

35:16.114 --> 35:17.323
to cause a hurricane?

35:19.200 --> 35:22.537
Too bad that he doesn't have
any wings Yeon-jin.,

35:27.208 --> 35:29.377
You and I both know

35:29.460 --> 35:31.629
he doesn't deserve
anything that beautiful.

35:31.712 --> 35:33.714
[dogs barking in distance]

35:37.844 --> 35:40.555
Myeong-o is nothing but an SD card.

35:41.430 --> 35:43.182
And I put him in the camera

35:43.266 --> 35:45.685
because I need him
to take a picture for me.

35:46.727 --> 35:49.313
[sighs] This really gonna
make me some money.

35:51.315 --> 35:54.986
Moon Dong-eun,
you're a lot more interesting now.

36:07.790 --> 36:13.004
ROOM 701
PATIENT: YOON JEONG-HWAN

36:20.636 --> 36:22.638
Did Mr. Yun get moved from room 701?

36:23.514 --> 36:27.268
Oh, you didn't know?
He suddenly went into shock this morning.

36:30.771 --> 36:32.398
[sorrowful music playing]

36:40.907 --> 36:41.782
[Yeo-jeong pants]

36:59.425 --> 37:01.844
[woman] Oh, are you okay?

37:02.428 --> 37:03.346
Isn't that hot?

37:08.267 --> 37:09.268
No, I'm okay.

37:20.738 --> 37:21.739
[music intensifies]

37:21.822 --> 37:22.823
[coffee splashing]

37:30.414 --> 37:32.416
[breathes heavily]

37:36.128 --> 37:37.672
[door keypad beeping]

37:39.257 --> 37:43.302
Ye-sol, did anyone mess with you
at school today? Did anyone hit you?

37:43.386 --> 37:44.470
Mommy, what's wrong?

37:44.553 --> 37:47.974
Even if your teacher does something
as punishment, that's not okay.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.810
Did anybody put something
really hot on your body?

37:50.893 --> 37:52.728
Why would anyone do that?

37:52.812 --> 37:54.063
That's so mean.

37:54.563 --> 37:56.440
You should be scolded, then.

37:57.733 --> 38:00.611
I'm going to play Among Us
with my friends.

38:04.740 --> 38:05.866
Ye-sol.

38:05.950 --> 38:07.201
-[panting]
-[door opens]

38:15.835 --> 38:18.212
[Hyeon-nam] Must visit
on Fridays once a week.

38:19.046 --> 38:21.924
Around three out of five pictures
I take are in focus now.

38:22.425 --> 38:24.427
[suspenseful music playing]

38:29.640 --> 38:32.101
PAGODA GO CLUB

38:59.170 --> 39:00.171
[chuckles wryly]

39:05.843 --> 39:07.386
[music trails off]

39:07.470 --> 39:10.348
[enchanting music playing]

40:12.410 --> 40:16.122
[Dong-eun] You know, I learned
the game of Go very quickly, Yeon-jin.

40:16.997 --> 40:18.916
It's a game with a clear purpose,

40:19.417 --> 40:23.671
where you can win if you take the house
that your opponent carefully built.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.091
It's beautiful.

40:38.394 --> 40:40.479
You haven't been here for a while.

40:40.563 --> 40:42.314
Yeah. I was working.

40:44.567 --> 40:45.734
And what do you do for work?

40:46.694 --> 40:49.488
Backstabbing naive men,
making them cry, ruining lives.

40:49.572 --> 40:50.573
[chuckles dryly]

40:51.991 --> 40:53.284
You get a lot of money from that?

40:54.034 --> 40:55.161
No, not really.

40:55.995 --> 40:57.163
I'm a pretty good person.

41:03.002 --> 41:04.962
Where did you learn how to play Go?

41:06.130 --> 41:07.256
At a park somewhere.

41:08.048 --> 41:11.135
[sighs] All your answers are unexpected.

41:19.143 --> 41:21.395
[dramatic music builds]

41:36.035 --> 41:37.411
It's 20,000 won per round?

41:47.213 --> 41:48.047
Final move.

41:49.715 --> 41:51.091
There's no way I can win.

41:53.135 --> 41:55.262
You gonna wire me the money, right?

41:56.180 --> 41:57.014
What?

41:57.932 --> 41:58.766
Oh.

42:06.232 --> 42:07.483
That was pretty fun.

42:10.611 --> 42:11.946
Fifty thousand.

42:14.073 --> 42:15.241
One more game?

42:15.741 --> 42:17.826
[dramatic music intensifies]

42:18.619 --> 42:20.120
[Dong-eun] By the way, Yeon-jin.

42:20.621 --> 42:24.416
Do you want to know
the real reason why I like to play Go?

42:27.753 --> 42:28.796
Wouldn't that be gambling?

42:30.923 --> 42:31.757
Would it?

42:32.258 --> 42:36.637
When you play Go,
you pursue your desires in silence.

42:36.720 --> 42:39.348
You seduce, and you fall.

42:39.848 --> 42:41.350
You strip each other bare.

42:43.143 --> 42:45.187
And if your opponent doesn't reciprocate…

42:48.232 --> 42:49.066
well, then…

42:51.569 --> 42:53.070
it's just a game of Go.

42:54.488 --> 42:57.157
Gambling sounds fun.

42:59.410 --> 43:01.412
[moody Korean pop song playing]
